{"id": null, "n": "0342020", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0342020", "type": "mod", "text": "從【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】【流布本】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0342021a", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0342021a", "type": "mod", "text": "（作是觀…邪觀）十六字【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】【流布本】"}
